 drug trafficking  organizations that are growing and that  really needs a much more reliable  attitude on the national government  while Colombia still has a long way to  go to rail its politics of violence and  corruption Sunday's elections showed  that many voters are ready for change  Allisyn ramp et al Jazeera Bogota
 

